L2.G3_IUI_1 → U L2.G3_IUI_2   # జ ja: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G3_IUI_2 → I L2.G4         # జ ja: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G4
L2.G4 → U L2.G4_UIU_1         # ర ra: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G4_UIU_1 → I L2.G4_UIU_2   # ర ra: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G4_UIU_2 → U L2.G5         # ర ra: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G5
L2.G5 → I L2.G5_IUI_1         # జ ja: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L2.G5_IUI_1 → U L2.G5_IUI_2   # జ ja: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L2.G5_IUI_2 → I L2.G6         # జ ja: symbol 3/3, complete → L2.G6
L2.G6 → U L2.G6_UNL_1         # గురువు guruvu: symbol 1/2 read, 1 to go
L2.G6_UNL_1 → ⏎ L3.G1         # గురువు guruvu: symbol 2/2, complete → L3.G1
L3.G1 → I L3.G1_IUI_1         # జ ja: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G1_IUI_1 → U L3.G1_IUI_2   # జ ja: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G1_IUI_2 → I L3.G2         # జ ja: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G2
L3.G2 → U L3.G2_UIU_1         # ర ra: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G2_UIU_1 → I L3.G2_UIU_2   # ర ra: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G2_UIU_2 → U L3.G3         # ర ra: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G3
L3.G3 → I L3.G3_IUI_1         # జ ja: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G3_IUI_1 → U L3.G3_IUI_2   # జ ja: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
L3.G3_IUI_2 → I L3.G4         # జ ja: symbol 3/3, complete → L3.G4
L3.G4 → U L3.G4_UIU_1         # ర ra: symbol 1/3 read, 2 to go
L3.G4_UIU_1 → I L3.G4_UIU_2   # ర ra: symbol 2/3 read, 1 to go
